[I] Light-weight, simple and fast XML parser for C++ with XPath support

[T] pugixml is a C++ XML processing library consisting of a DOM-like
[T] interface with rich traversal and modification capabilities, an
[T] extremely fast XML parser and an XPath 1.0 implementation. It offers
[T] full Unicode support with conversions between encodings.

[U] https://pugixml.org

[A] Pugixml Authors
